  "title": "2027 Jeep Wrangler Laredo Pairs Retro Looks with Modern Off-Road Capability",
  "summary": "Jeep has reached into its deep toy box of heritage trims for the ninth of its Twelve 4 Twelve releases to bring back the Laredo trim for 2027. The 2027 Jeep Wrangler Laredo will offer unique badging and color treatments inside and out, along with outstanding off-road capability thanks to its standard 35-inch tire package. […]",
